<title>USA: Spreckels Industries to buy Columbus notes.</title>
<headline>Spreckels Industries to buy Columbus notes.</headline>
<dateline>AMHERST, N.Y. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spreckels Industries Inc plans to offer to buy in cash all of Columbus McKinnon Corp's 11-1/2 percent senior secured notes due in 2000.</p>
<p>Columbus said in a statement Spreckels, which is its major shareholder, would buy the notes at a price equal to about 108.125 percent of the outstanding principal amount, plus accrued interest of the $70 million in notes.</p>
<p>It said Spreckels planned to make its tender offer on November 15.</p>
</text>
